iv>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="conferences"/><category term="travel"/><category term="creak"/><category term="sociolinguistics"/><category term="phonetics"/><category term="perception"/><category term="fun"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Invited talk at ASA 190 in Philadelphia, with media coverage and tourist things]]></summary></entry></feed>